{
    "title": "MSC for Me",
    "description": "The official MSC for Me app works alongside other digital channels onboard to ensure you have the information you need at your fingertips. Plus, the app is free and even on board you will not need to purchase any internet package in order to use it.\r\n\r\nAvailable for guests travelling on all ships except for MSC Armonia, MSC Lirica, MSC Sinfonia, MSC Opera and MSC Orchestra.Coming soon on MSC World America.\r\n\r\nPre-cruise features \r\nStart organising your cruise experience even before boarding. \r\n\r\nDo your check-in and register your credit card in advance.\r\nEnjoy a smooth embarkation by checking in via the MSC for Me app and pair a credit card with your Cruise Card, so you\u2019re ready to go as soon as you board.\r\n\r\nBook now and take advantage of our pre-cruise rates.\r\nPlan your fun time and book your favourite activities even before sailing*. Discover exciting shore excursions, entertaining events, specialty dining options and much more about the onboard experience.\r\n\r\n\r\nOnboard features\r\nEnjoy a relaxing and worry-free cruise experience.\r\n\r\nKeep in contact with your friends and family with the MSC for Me chat.\r\nUse the MSC for Me free chat to talk with your onboard mates.\r\n\r\nNever miss what\u2019s important and book your activities.\r\nSearch and reserve activities and then get notifications for your booked events, restaurants, shore excursions, shopping and all the significant information, directly on your smartphone. \r\n\r\nPurchase Internet packages\r\nChoose the internet package that best fits your needs and manage Internet consumption directly from the MSC for Me app.\r\n\r\nChoose your speciality restaurant and drink packages.\r\nBook your favorite speciality restaurant and drink packages, fascinating events, special dining options, and much more.\r\n\r\nKeep track of your onboard expenses and transactions.\r\nPair a credit card and associate Guests with your booking number to your billing account in order to manage your Cruise Card transactions directly in-app. \r\n\r\nWe are constantly working on adding new features and making the app available on more ships. Please take a minute to give your feedback on the MSC for Me app to help us improve it.\r\n\r\n*Please note: the MSC for Me app functionality may vary from ship to ship and across different markets.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The official MSC for Me app works alongside other digital channels onboard to ensure you have the information you need at your fingertips. Plus, the app is free and even on board you will not need to purchase any internet package in order to use it.<br><br>Available for guests travelling on all ships except for MSC Armonia, MSC Lirica, MSC Sinfonia, MSC Opera and MSC Orchestra.Coming soon on MSC World America.<br><br>Pre-cruise features <br>Start organising your cruise experience even before boarding. <br><br>Do your check-in and register your credit card in advance.<br>Enjoy a smooth embarkation by checking in via the MSC for Me app and pair a credit card with your Cruise Card, so you\u2019re ready to go as soon as you board.<br><br>Book now and take advantage of our pre-cruise rates.<br>Plan your fun time and book your favourite activities even before sailing*. Discover exciting shore excursions, entertaining events, specialty dining options and much more about the onboard experience.<br><br><br>Onboard features<br>Enjoy a relaxing and worry-free cruise experience.<br><br>Keep in contact with your friends and family with the MSC for Me chat.<br>Use the MSC for Me free chat to talk with your onboard mates.<br><br>Never miss what\u2019s important and book your activities.<br>Search and reserve activities and then get notifications for your booked events, restaurants, shore excursions, shopping and all the significant information, directly on your smartphone. <br><br>Purchase Internet packages<br>Choose the internet package that best fits your needs and manage Internet consumption directly from the MSC for Me app.<br><br>Choose your speciality restaurant and drink packages.<br>Book your favorite speciality restaurant and drink packages, fascinating events, special dining options, and much more.<br><br>Keep track of your onboard expenses and transactions.<br>Pair a credit card and associate Guests with your booking number to your billing account in order to manage your Cruise Card transactions directly in-app. <br><br>We are constantly working on adding new features and making the app available on more ships. Please take a minute to give your feedback on the MSC for Me app to help us improve it.<br><br>*Please note: the MSC for Me app functionality may vary from ship to ship and across different markets.",
